# Cells Yosys may not use when it synthesizes this design (LibreLane SYNTH_EXCLUDED_CELL_FILE).
#
# This is the sky130A default list (open_pdks 8afc8346, the PDK the Tiny Tapeout
# action uses: sky130/openlane/sky130_fd_sc_hd/no_synth.cells) with only its
# drive-strength-1 entries removed. The default bans 141 *_1 cells, so every gate
# maps to its _2 version and the design grows about 20%: at the configured tile
# that leaves no room to place (GPL utilization 97.7%, then DPL-0036).
# Cells with known layout problems stay banned through the PDK's separate
# PNR_EXCLUDED_CELL_FILE (drc_exclude.cells), which this file does not touch.
# Placement and CTS still resize any cell that needs more drive.
#
# Regenerate: git -C open_pdks show 8afc8346:sky130/openlane/sky130_fd_sc_hd/no_synth.cells | grep -v '_1$'
